Republicans have failed to regulate AI and have absolutely no plan or sense of urgency. 

House Republicans have been an absolute failure in making life affordable and tackling today’s pressing issues. 

@HouseDemocrats are ready to lead and deliver for the American people. https://t.co/mVx7y00NIX

We can harness the promise of AI to improve our lives but we have to first address the peril. 

Thank you to the experts from New Jersey’s academic institutions who joined our roundtable with my friend and @EnergyCommerce Ranking Member @FrankPallone. Important conversation, more work to do. 

@HouseDemocrats are ready to lead and deliver responsible AI solutions for the American people.
